@startuml
title Buying YT on Pendle sells PT into the pool
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FDEEEE
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #B54A4A
participant "Buyer" as U
participant "Pendle router" as R
participant "PT/SY pool" as P
participant "YT contract" as Y
U -> R: swapExactSyForYt(320,000 SY in total)
R -> P: swap: request SY out, PT owed
P -> R: SY sent first (flash swap)
R -> Y: mintPY(buyer SY + pool SY)
Y -> U: YT
Y -> P: PT (repays ptOwed)
note over P: pool holds more PT, less SY\nimplied APY up, PT price down
@enduml
